You gain greater facility with your acrobatic moves, lowering the cooldowns of Vault, Tumble, and Trained Reactions by [0, 1, 2, 3, 4 (TL1-5)], and their stamina costs by [2.0, 4.7, 6.5, 7.8, 8.8 (TL1-5)].

At Rank 3 you also gain 10% global speed for 1 turn after Trained Reactions activates. At rank 5 this speed bonus improves to 20% and lasts for 2 turns.
